  <entry>
    <title>偶书</title>
    <link href="/2024/10/15/gushi-tang/"/>
    <url>/2024/10/15/gushi-tang/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>偶书<br>唐.刘叉<br>日出扶桑一张高，<br>人间万事细如毛。<br>野夫怒见不平处，<br>磨损胸中万古刀。</p>]]></content>
    
    
